  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "epan: Fix ex_opt_get_next leak.",
  "description": "This is a re-issue of MR !21295 because I confused my git branches, pushed some other work over the top of that MR, made a mess, and couldn't figure out how to recover things to a sensible state.  The content of this new MR is the same as the old one before I clobbered it.  Sorry for the extra noise...\n\n----\n\nChange ex_opt_get_next to return a non-const char pointer; It's designed so\nthat the caller owns the returned heap pointer, so the caller should be allowed\nto modify or free it if it wants.\n\nFix the callsites to always free the returned string.",
